[
  {
    "id": "gossip_disclaimer",
    "text": "Odd Sam says none of the rumours about the hackers or the cat will help you leave the city, and that he finds them useful for waiting.",
    "source": "npc:odd_sam",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "person:odd_sam"
    ],
    "links": [],
    "alsoFrom": [
      "npc:wren"
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "hackers_exist",
    "text": "A small crew of hackers called Null Hypothesis shares one great hatred, MERIDIAN, and very little else.",
    "source": "npc:odd_sam",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:odd_sam"
    ],
    "links": [],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "hackers_split",
    "text": "The crew fell apart over Dex Harlow, who made Mari Quade, best friend of his teammate Juno Park, deeply uncomfortable and would not stop.",
    "source": "npc:teeter",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:dex_harlow",
      "person:juno_park",
      "person:mari_quade"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "hackers_exist",
        "kind": "supports"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "juno_took_toolkit",
    "text": "On her way out, Juno Park took Dex's toolkit, Skeleton Key. He says it was a copy. It was not a copy.",
    "source": "npc:mrs_adeyemi_roth",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:juno_park",
      "person:dex_harlow"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "hackers_split",
        "kind": "supports"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "dex_gift_story",
    "text": "Dex says Juno never stole anything: he gave her Skeleton Key as a gift, and she is being dramatic.",
    "source": "npc:odd_sam",
    "reliability": "false",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:dex_harlow"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "juno_took_toolkit",
        "kind": "contradicts"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "skeleton_renamed",
    "text": "Juno renamed Skeleton Key to Dex Was Here, and every program it opens now prints: SEE ATTACHED HR POLICY.",
    "source": "npc:quill",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:juno_park"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "juno_took_toolkit",
        "kind": "supports"
      }
    ],
    "alsoFrom": [
      "doc:team_chat_log"
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sam_apology_fee",
    "text": "Odd Sam's ledger terminal opens with the stolen toolkit. He will not say how he got it, and he charges extra for the apology it prints.",
    "source": "npc:ticket",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:odd_sam"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "skeleton_renamed",
        "kind": "supports"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ox_hides",
    "text": "Ox Lindqvist, the one member who stayed out of it, has been asked to mediate nine times and now sleeps in a pump housing in the Belt.",
    "source": "npc:gus_varga",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:ox_lindqvist",
      "place:pump4"
    ],
    "links": [],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "dex_apology_form",
    "text": "Dex filed Form 12-B to apply for permission to apologise, and was refused at Window 7, where Dov Anselm says he has seen the form.",
    "source": "npc:dov_anselm",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:dex_harlow",
      "place:permit_hall"
    ],
    "links": [],
    "alsoFrom": [
      "doc:permit_hall"
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "dex_rewrote_it",
    "text": "Dex has rewritten Skeleton Key from memory and is selling it as version two.",
    "source": "npc:silas",
    "reliability": "outdated",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:dex_harlow"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "dex_cannot_rewrite",
        "kind": "updates"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "dex_cannot_rewrite",
    "text": "He cannot. He never commented the code, and Juno removed his name from every header, so even he cannot find the clever parts.",
    "source": "doc:team_chat_log",
    "reliability": "true",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:dex_harlow",
      "person:juno_park"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "juno_took_toolkit",
        "kind": "supports"
      }
    ],
    "for": [
      "gossip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "juno_works_for_pell",
    "text": "Juno Park has been hired by MERIDIAN and now works for Auditor Pell.",
    "source": "npc:pell",
    "reliability": "false",
    "tags": [
      "topic:gossip",
      "topic:hackers",
      "person:juno_park",
      "person:pell"
    ],
    "links": [
      {
        "to": "juno_petty_good",
